      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Hello Everyone!\n\nMy name is Lydia-Rae Wehmeyer (Lydia), pronouns are she/her/hers and I will be your new Crowdfunding and Customer Service Specialist for GTG! \n\nI am so happy to be here! A little bit about me:\n\nI've been in the tabletop industry for about 4 years now on the convention side presenting panels and workshops on how to incorporate tabletop gaming and RPGS with education, mental health, accessibility and DE&I. In addition, I am also a DE&I consultant for Stonemaier Games and have worked on many projects with companies such as Lucky Duck and Japanime.\n\nI've always wanted to find a place in the hobby and didn't get into it until I was 21. My entry way game was Lords of Waterdeep and my love for board games have been strong ever since.\n\nI look forward to communicating with all of you and have a wonderful day.",
